    and `filled` switch it, and a colour class is the Severity (`info`, `success`, `warning`,
    `error`, and any other palette colour). With no colour it is Severity.Normal: text-primary on
    dark-hover. Text and outlined alerts draw their TEXT in the colour's darken shade and only the
    icon in the colour itself; filled ones are the colour with its contrast text, at weight 500.
    The colour is inherited, so put the message and a PathIcon inside and both follow it.
